# Package-relative ignores.
#
# These live here rather than in the repository root because a gitignore
# pattern containing a separator is anchored to the directory of the
# .gitignore that declares it. `inst/resources/` and `src/*.o` at the root
# stopped matching the moment the package moved under pkg-r/, which would
# have let compiled objects and generated asset directories become
# committable without anyone noticing.
inst/resources/
inst/tiles/
inst/tiles-agent/
inst/pkgs
inst/hex/output
src/*.o
src/*.so
src/*.dll
